        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sathish Kalathil, Jacques Feyder\n- Works: Jalachhayam, Veena Vaadanam\n- Topics: Malayalam cinema, experimental filmmaking, documentary film\n\nFacts:\n- Jacques Feyder was a Belgian actor, screenwriter, and film director who lived from 21 July 1885 to 24 May 1948.\n- Jacques Feyder worked principally in France and also worked in the USA, Britain, and Germany.\n- Sathish Kalathil is known in the Malayalam cinema industry for his experimental works.\n- Sathish Kalathil's debut movie Jalachhayam was released in 2010 and was discussed for its experimental approach.\n- Veena Vaadanam, also titled Recital of Music, is an Indian documentary film in the Malayalam language.\n- Veena Vaadanam was directed by Sathish Kalathil.",
